271
00:19:46,617 --> 00:19:51,617
No big deal. It's not like they do it all the time. It's a nice day.

272
00:19:51,617 --> 00:20:08,617
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

273
00:20:08,617 --> 00:20:22,857
Should we go after Frankie?

274
00:20:23,517 --> 00:20:24,857
And start looking where?

275
00:20:26,297 --> 00:20:30,417
Oh man, looks like these idiots really didn't know where he took the money.

276
00:20:31,457 --> 00:20:35,897
And if we do find him, if he spent it, then there's no getting it back.

277
00:20:38,617 --> 00:20:42,877
What now? Even if we wait around for him, he may not be back for quite a while.

278
00:20:45,217 --> 00:20:51,537
Okay, the first aid treatment is all done. We need to take him back on a stretcher so I could use some help over here!

279
00:20:52,297 --> 00:20:58,057
Hanging around here won't do any good. Let's head back to the ship for now. We left Nami there all by herself.

280
00:20:58,677 --> 00:21:02,837
And Robin's still missing. The ship's a problem too.

281
00:21:03,677 --> 00:21:03,997
Yeah.

282
00:21:04,637 --> 00:21:05,517
Hey, Luffy!

283
00:21:08,617 --> 00:21:11,177
I've made a decision.

284
00:21:12,517 --> 00:21:12,817
Huh?

285
00:21:14,197 --> 00:21:15,477
About the ship.

286
00:21:24,917 --> 00:21:29,877
It's time to part ways with the Mary. We'll say goodbye to her here.

287
00:21:29,877 --> 00:21:39,097
Thank you.

288
00:21:39,097 --> 00:22:09,077
See you next time.

289
00:23:06,184 --> 00:23:08,684
One Piece! Big fight under the moon!

290
00:23:08,684 --> 00:23:11,184
The pirate flag flutters with sorrow!

291
00:23:11,184 --> 00:23:13,184
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

